entries[386667] = { ["name"] = "Tinker: Polarity Amplifier", ["text"] = "3.5 sec cast\nTools: Arclight Spanner , Gyromatic Micro-Adjustor\nReagents:\nAwakened Ire , Handful of Serevite Bolts (8), Greased-Up Gears (3), Arclight Capacitor , Reinforced Machine Chassis\nOptional Reagents:\nLesser Illustrious Insight (#92) , Spare Parts (#230)\nMeticulously crafted tinkers of a high quality have a much greater chance of succeeding.\nVendor:\nEraneth\nZone:\nValdrakken\nCost:\n3\n\nTinker: Polarity Amplifier\nTinker Module\nUnique-Equipped: Polarity Amplifier (1)\nGrants a magnetic charge that changes periodically.\nAim a magnet toward an enemy player. If your polarities are opposite , you both will be rooted for 6 sec. If they are identical, you both will be repelled away from each other.\n\nYour target must also have a magnetic charge.\n58\n\"Tinker quality and engineering specialization impact success chance. This warranty only applies to Dragon Isles equipment.\"" }
