entries[386696] = { ["name"] = "Decimating Bolt", ["text"] = "4% of base mana 40 yd range\n2 sec cast 45 sec cooldown\nDemonology, Demonology (Destruction Warlock)\nHurl bolts of decimating magic at your target, dealing [4 * (367.36% of Spell Power)] Shadow damage and increasing the damage of your next 3 Demonbolts by 40%.\n\nDecimating Bolt's damage, and the bonus to Demonbolt both increase as your target's health decreases.\n\nDestruction, Destruction (Demonology Warlock)\nHurl bolts of decimating magic at your target, dealing [4 * (367.36% of Spell Power)] Shadow damage and increasing the damage of your next 3 Incinerates by 40%.\n\nDecimating Bolt's damage, and the bonus to Incinerate both increase as your target's health decreases.\n\nAffliction\nHurl bolts of decimating magic at your target, dealing [4 * (367.36% of Spell Power)] Shadow damage and increasing the damage of your next 3 by 40%.\n\nDecimating Bolt's damage, and the bonus to both increase as your target's health decreases." }
